<BES xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="BES.xsd">
  <Fixlet>
    <Title>Warning - Windows 10 Security Center may present notification during AV installation</Title>
    <Description><![CDATA[<P>The Windows Security Center is enabled.</P>
<P>On initial&nbsp;installation of an Anti-virus product the security center may prompt the user indicating a lack of up-to-date definitions.</P>
<P>For general information or to report issues with C3 Protect content please visit GitHub here: <A href="https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Protect">https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Protect</A></P>]]></Description>
    <Relevance><![CDATA[windows of operating system and version of operating system > "10.0.0" and name of operating system does not contain "Win2"]]></Relevance>
    <Category>Anti-Virus</Category>
    <Source>Internal</Source>
    <SourceReleaseDate>2016-04-16</SourceReleaseDate>
